terms.medium_def:
A man from the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.8.37; 
referred to as Eleasah (אֶלְעָשָׂה), or Eshek (עֵ֫שֶׁק); 
son of Binea; 
a brother of Raphah and Azel; 
father of Ulam, Jeush and Eliphelet. § a Benjamite, late descendant of Saul
